# THC Open Mindfulness MCP — environment variables
#
# V1 requires NO secrets. This server is public, read-only, and unauthenticated.
# The only variable below controls which REST API instance the MCP tools call.
#
# IMPORTANT: this is intentionally the ONLY variable a caller can influence
# indirectly (and even then, only by whoever deploys this server — never by
# an MCP tool argument). Tool inputs can never override this value; that
# would open an SSRF hole. See src/lib/apiClient.ts.

# Base URL of The Holistic Care's public REST API. Defaults to production
# if unset, so this line is optional for a production deploy — set it only
# to point a local/dev instance at something else (e.g. a local API dev server).
THC_API_BASE_URL=https://api.theholisticcare.com
